WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.242 --> 00:00:04.990
A friend's birthday is coming up, or you'd like to treat your mum to a beauty day?

00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:09.150
A salon gift card is a present that's both beautiful and useful.

00:00:09.491 --> 00:00:11.230
You buy it online, in about a minute.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:15.161
Open the salon's website, and scroll down to Gift cards.

00:00:15.294 --> 00:00:20.121
Each card shows the service, the discount, how long it's valid, and its price.

00:00:20.476 --> 00:00:23.081
Choose the one you like, and tap Buy this card.

00:00:23.745 --> 00:00:27.000
Enter your name, your email, and a phone number if you like.

00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:28.440
Then tap Buy.

00:00:28.774 --> 00:00:32.200
The screen says Thanks for buying a gift card, with your card code.

00:00:32.793 --> 00:00:36.203
The card code and a QR code are emailed to you straight away.

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:39.243
The card is activated once the salon confirms your payment.

00:00:39.431 --> 00:00:42.043
You can forward that email to the person you're giving it to.

00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:47.334
At the salon, you, or the person who received it, simply show the QR code,

00:00:47.284 --> 00:00:49.819
or read out the card code to the staff.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.619
They check it, and record one use on the card.

00:00:52.963 --> 00:00:54.299
Now take the quiz below!
